Changes:
 cafe-sensors-applet (2.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium
 .
   * control:
     - Remove redundant Uploaders field
     - Update Homepage
     - remove obsolete 'Rules-Requires-Root: no'
     - remove shlibs:Depends in libcafe-sensors-applet-plugin-dev
   * rules:
     - remove obsolete get-orig-source
     - Drop dh_missing override, --fail-missing is default in compat 13
   * watch: upgrade to version 5
   * drop cafe-sensors-applet.lintian-overrides
   * New upstream release
